live-for-speed-linux (0.3.1-2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian release.
  * Package the free wrapper only in contrib; no proprietary runtime payloads
    are built, installed, or redistributed.
  * Add offline build tests and unprivileged installed-package autopkgtests.
  * Carry runtime hardening pending the next upstream wrapper release.
  * Verify the pinned Arch Wine package signature before safe extraction.
  * Add deterministic signature and hostile-archive regression fixtures.

